IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ccc-core`
IMPORT `ccc16-dna-definitions`

-- ccc16-tests-dna-rows.l4 -- one assertion for every row of every list of "primary designated offence" and "secondary designated offence" in section 487.04 (lines 9300-9541),
-- written by scripts/gen_dnatests.py from the text of those lines by a second, independent parse (not from the encoding's output), with a not-listed control for each list.
-- A row naming a whole section is asked with no subsection; a row naming a subsection or paragraph with that subsection.

-- an offence of this Act as it reads now, charged itself, indictable, maximum fourteen years, for no particular purpose
GIVEN sec IS A NUMBER
      sub IS A STRING
GIVETH A `s 487.04 facts of the offence`
`s 487.04 rows test: this Act now` MEANS `s 487.04 facts of the offence` WITH
    `the provision that creates the offence` IS `Provision of the Code` OF sec, sub
    `where that provision is found` IS `s 487.04 this Act as it reads now`
    `how the person is charged` IS `s 487.04 with the listed offence itself`
    `the purpose` IS `s 487.04 another purpose`
    `the offence may be prosecuted by indictment` IS TRUE
    `the offence is prosecuted by indictment` IS TRUE
    `the maximum imprisonment for the offence` IS `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 14, 0, 0, FALSE)
    `the intent of an assault under subsection 246(1) is to commit an offence referred to in subparagraphs (b)(i) to (vi)` IS TRUE

-- the same, summary only and with no maximum stated, so that only a list (not paragraph (a)) can make it secondary
GIVEN sec IS A NUMBER
      sub IS A STRING
GIVETH A `s 487.04 facts of the offence`
`s 487.04 rows test: a summary-only provision of this Act` MEANS `s 487.04 facts of the offence` WITH
    `the provision that creates the offence` IS `Provision of the Code` OF sec, sub
    `where that provision is found` IS `s 487.04 this Act as it reads now`
    `how the person is charged` IS `s 487.04 with the listed offence itself`
    `the purpose` IS `s 487.04 another purpose`
    `the offence may be prosecuted by indictment` IS FALSE
    `the offence is prosecuted by indictment` IS FALSE
    `the maximum imprisonment for the offence` IS `no imprisonment is stated`
    `the intent of an assault under subsection 246(1) is to commit an offence referred to in subparagraphs (b)(i) to (vi)` IS FALSE

-- a provision of another instrument (the Cannabis Act, the Controlled Drugs and Substances Act) that may be prosecuted by indictment, maximum fourteen years (paragraphs (a.1) and (b) of "secondary designated offence" ask for both)
GIVEN sec IS A NUMBER
      sub IS A STRING
      inst IS A `s 487.04 where the provision is found`
GIVETH A `s 487.04 facts of the offence`
`s 487.04 rows test: found in indictable` MEANS `s 487.04 facts of the offence` WITH
    `the provision that creates the offence` IS `Provision of the Code` OF sec, sub
    `where that provision is found` IS inst
    `how the person is charged` IS `s 487.04 with the listed offence itself`
    `the purpose` IS `s 487.04 another purpose`
    `the offence may be prosecuted by indictment` IS TRUE
    `the offence is prosecuted by indictment` IS TRUE
    `the maximum imprisonment for the offence` IS `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 14, 0, 0, FALSE)
    `the intent of an assault under subsection 246(1) is to commit an offence referred to in subparagraphs (b)(i) to (vi)` IS FALSE

-- a provision before the conveyances amendment that may be prosecuted by indictment (for the rows of paragraph (d.2))
GIVEN sec IS A NUMBER
      sub IS A STRING
GIVETH A `s 487.04 facts of the offence`
`s 487.04 rows test: found in d2` MEANS `s 487.04 facts of the offence` WITH
    `the provision that creates the offence` IS `Provision of the Code` OF sec, sub
    `where that provision is found` IS `s 487.04 this Act as it read from time to time before the day on which section 14 of the Act to amend the Criminal Code (offences relating to conveyances) comes into force`
    `how the person is charged` IS `s 487.04 with the listed offence itself`
    `the purpose` IS `s 487.04 another purpose`
    `the offence may be prosecuted by indictment` IS TRUE
    `the offence is prosecuted by indictment` IS TRUE
    `the maximum imprisonment for the offence` IS `no imprisonment is stated`
    `the intent of an assault under subsection 246(1) is to commit an offence referred to in subparagraphs (b)(i) to (vi)` IS FALSE

-- a provision of another instrument or vintage, charged itself; the last argument is the intent of an assault under subsection 246(1)
GIVEN sec IS A NUMBER
      sub IS A STRING
      inst IS A `s 487.04 where the provision is found`
      intent IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 487.04 facts of the offence`
`s 487.04 rows test: found in` MEANS `s 487.04 facts of the offence` WITH
    `the provision that creates the offence` IS `Provision of the Code` OF sec, sub
    `where that provision is found` IS inst
    `how the person is charged` IS `s 487.04 with the listed offence itself`
    `the purpose` IS `s 487.04 another purpose`
    `the offence may be prosecuted by indictment` IS FALSE
    `the offence is prosecuted by indictment` IS FALSE
    `the maximum imprisonment for the offence` IS `no imprisonment is stated`
    `the intent of an assault under subsection 246(1) is to commit an offence referred to in subparagraphs (b)(i) to (vi)` IS intent

